          "text": "式中E为弹性模量，$\\bar{E}=E(1-D)$为受损材料的弹性模量。由（1—16）式还可\n得重要公式：",
          "reading_order": 10,
          "tags": []
        },
        {
          "label": "equ",
          "bbox": [
            179,
            504,
            513,
            536
          ],
          "text": "$$ D  = 1 - { \\frac { \\dot { E } } { E } } \\quad( 1 - 1 7 )$$",
          "reading_order": 11,
          "tags": []
        },
        {
          "label": "para",
          "bbox": [
            76,
            543,
            379,
            560
          ],
          "text": "这是通过材料弹性模量的变化来定义损伤变量的形式。",
          "reading_order": 12,
          "tags": []
        },
        {
          "label": "para",
          "bbox": [
            100,
            565,
            266,
            583
          ],
          "text": "如果在（1—16）式中，定义：",
          "reading_order": 13,
          "tags": []
        },
        {
          "label": "equ",
          "bbox": [
            106,
            589,
            270,
            607
          ],
          "text": "$$\\tilde{\\varepsilon}=\\varepsilon(1-D)\\quad(1-18)$$",
          "reading_order": 14,
          "tags": []
        },
        {
          "label": "para",
          "bbox": [
            77,
            611,
            210,
            628
          ],
          "text": "$\\overline{\\varepsilon}$ 称为有效应变，这时：",
          "reading_order": 15,
          "tags": []
        },
        {
          "label": "equ",
          "bbox": [
            104,
            634,
            281,
            651
          ],
          "text": "$$\\sigma=E \\tilde{\\varepsilon}\\quad(1-19)$$",
          "reading_order": 16,
          "tags": []
        },
        {
          "label": "para",
          "bbox": [
            76,
            655,
            238,
            672
          ],
          "text": "此公式称为应力等价性假设。",
          "reading_order": 17,
          "tags": []
        },
